2026-11-06T03:02:08.7371696Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
2026-11-06T03:02:08.7372196Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
2026-11-06T03:02:08.7372736Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
2026-11-06T03:02:08.7372922Z 
2026-11-06T03:02:08.7373171Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
2026-11-06T03:02:08.7373451Z 
